    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[0].subtitleText
      value: "Commencing <color=#FFFFFF>Go-Go tutorial program</color> \u2026 the
        tutorial will consist of five tasks."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[1].subtitleText
      value: You can use the <color=#FFFFFF>Go-Go interaction technique</color> 
        to extend your arm to interact with distant objects.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].subtitleText
      value: To retrieve the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> on the table, you must 
        <color=#FFFFFF>stretch</color> your arm outward and use the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color>
        button to grab.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].subtitleText
      value: Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the empty slot on your
        left hand to enable teleportation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].subtitleText
      value: You can now tilt the <color=#FFFFFF>[LEFT THUMBSTICK]</color> forward
        to teleport to a desired destination.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].subtitleText
      value: Teleport onto the <color=#FFFFFF>orange rings</color> in front of the
        pedestal next to the computer. Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color>
        into the pedestal to begin the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[6].subtitleText
      value: The computer shows a <color=#FFFFFF>button sequence</color> highlighted
        in yellow. Press the <color=#FFFFFF>buttons</color> in the correct sequence.
        Stretch your arm outward and grab it using the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color>
        button.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[7].subtitleText
      value: Grab the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> and teleport to the next pedestal
        in the same room. Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the pedestal
        to begin the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[8].subtitleText
      value: Grab and rotate the <color=#FFFFFF>valve</color> on the wall. Stretch
        your arm outward to grab the valve using the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color>
        button to rotate it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[9].subtitleText
      value: Grab the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> and teleport through the two
        doors to the next pedestal. After completing a task, the <color=#87FFFF>blue
        sparks</color> of the electric tubes in the ceiling will guide you onward.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[10].subtitleText
      value: Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the pedestal to begin
        the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[11].subtitleText
      value: Grab and insert the <color=#FFFFFF>chip</color> into the <color=#FFFFFF>plug</color>
        on the <color=#FFFFFF>factory machine</color>. Grab the <color=#FFFFFF>chip</color>
        using the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color> button and stretch your arm outward
        to insert it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[12].subtitleText
      value: Grab the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> and teleport to the next pedestal
        in the same room. Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the pedestal
        to begin the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[13].subtitleText
      value: Grab and insert the <color=#FFFFFF>fuse</color> on the ground into the
        <color=#FFFFFF>fusebox</color>. Stretch your arm outward and grab it using
        the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color> button.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[14].subtitleText
      value: Grab and pull the <color=#FFFFFF>lever</color> on the wall. Stretch
        your arm outward and grab it using the <color=#FFFFFF>[SELECT]</color> button
        to pull the lever.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[15].subtitleText
      value: Congratulations, you have now completed the tutorial!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2207946992050787605, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[16].subtitleText
      value: Grab the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> and teleport back through the
        door and head further into the factory to complete the remaining tasks.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
