    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[0].subtitleText
      value: "Commencing <color=#FFFFFF>Scaled HOMER tutorial program</color>\u2026
        the tutorial will consist of five tasks."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[1].subtitleText
      value: You can use the <color=#FFFFFF>Scaled HOMER interaction technique</color>
        to relocate your arm to interact with distant objects. Your arm is <color=#FFFFFF>extended</color>
        based on <color=#FFFFFF>velocity</color> (speed).
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[2].subtitleText
      value: To retrieve the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> on the table, you must
        use the <color=#FFFFFF>[A]</color> button to aim and the <color=#FFFFFF>[TRIGGER]</color>
        button to shoot, grab, and retract.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[3].subtitleText
      value: Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the empty slot on your
        left hand to enable teleportation.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[4].subtitleText
      value: You can now tilt the <color=#FFFFFF>[LEFT THUMBSTICK]</color> forward
        to teleport to a desired destination.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[5].subtitleText
      value: Teleport onto the <color=#FFFFFF>orange rings</color> in front of the
        pedestal next to the computer. Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color>
        into the pedestal to begin the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[6].subtitleText
      value: The computer shows a <color=#FFFFFF>button sequence</color> highlighted
        in yellow. Press the <color=#FFFFFF>buttons</color> in the correct sequence.
        Aim at a <color=#FFFFFF>button</color> using the <color=#FFFFFF>[A]</color>
        button and grab it using the <color=#FFFFFF>[TRIGGER]</color> button.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[7].subtitleText
      value: Grab the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> and teleport to the next pedestal
        in the same room. Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the pedestal
        to begin the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[8].subtitleText
      value: 'Grab and rotate the <color=#FFFFFF>valve</color> on the wall. Aim at
        the <color=#FFFFFF>valve</color> using the <color=#FFFFFF>[A]</color> button
        and grab it using the <color=#FFFFFF>[TRIGGER]</color> button to rotate it. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[9].subtitleText
      value: Grab the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> and teleport through the two
        doors to the next pedestal. After completing a task, the <color=#87FFFF>blue
        sparks</color> of the electric tubes in the ceiling will guide you onward.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
