      value: Place the <color=#87FFFF>blue orb</color> into the pedestal to begin
        the task.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2954497517315875966, guid: ab189d3cea7baa748aaa88219c12dd9c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: steps.Array.data[11].subtitleText
      value: Grab and insert the <color=#FFFFFF>chip</color> into the <color=#FFFFFF>plug</color>
        on the <color=#FFFFFF>factory machine</color>. Aim at the <color=#FFFFFF>chip</color>
        using the <color=#FFFFFF>[A]</color> button and grab it using the <color=#FFFFFF>[TRIGGER]</color>.
        Your arm is <color=#FFFFFF>extended</color> based on <color=#FFFFFF>velocity</color>
